# What people who work with the material say about it. This is not the source and it is
# not our reading: it is somebody with the collections in front of them telling us
# something, quoted and attributed. It shows on the record it bears on.
# id|who|when|what they said|source
PL-NH-016|the Head of Botany, Manchester Museum|2026|Although we're Manchester Museum, our herbarium hasn't got a huge amount of material from within Greater Manchester. We have more extensive collections from the rest of the UK, continental Europe and beyond. Our collectors seem to have concentrated on collecting that which they couldn't readily get access to, rather than the things which were on their doorsteps and which might flower again next year.|https://museumcollections.manchester.ac.uk/collections/?s=greater+manchester&filter%5Bcategory.value.keyword%5D%5B%5D=Botany&view=grid
